    "Cenário": ["Map", "マップ"], "cenário": ["map", "マップ"], "Abrir cenário...": ["Open map...", "マップを開く..."], "Sem cenário (chão simples)": ["No map (plain floor)", "マップなし（シンプルな床）"], "{nome} (o da sala)": ["{nome} (the room's)", "{nome}（ルームのもの）"],
    "Abrir cenário: .blend, .glb, .gltf, .fbx, .obj, .dae, .stl, .ply, .3ds, .3mf, .usdz, ZIP ou .unitypackage": ["Open map: .blend, .glb, .gltf, .fbx, .obj, .dae, .stl, .ply, .3ds, .3mf, .usdz, ZIP or .unitypackage", "マップを開く: .blend、.glb、.gltf、.fbx、.obj、.dae、.stl、.ply、.3ds、.3mf、.usdz、ZIP、.unitypackage"],
