    "Conversa com ": ["Chat with ", "会話: "], "Diga oi.": ["Say hi.", "あいさつしてみよう。"], "Ela": ["She", "彼女"], "Ela ainda não sabe nada sobre você.": ["She doesn't know anything about you yet.", "まだあなたのことを何も知りません。"],
    "O que ela lembra": ["What she remembers", "覚えていること"], "Ensinar": ["Teach", "教える"], "Ensinar algo (ex.: Gosta de café sem açúcar.)": ["Teach something (e.g.: Likes coffee without sugar.)", "何かを教える（例: 砂糖なしのコーヒーが好き。）"], "Esquecer": ["Forget", "忘れる"],
